s and collectively hatch one from out of this world.","path":"/game/98209635344835-the-hatch","slug":"98209635344835-the-hatch","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6444a8b67ad713b59316196d7380a900e1c385b0acf758e39545bf9132c10ad8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-648cbb2e44cebcc83241a2b76170ba0a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":166020541,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-10T15:32:36.759Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox Presents","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":105344022671234,"name":"Milky [Beta]","desc":"Welcome to Milky — where numbers go up, your sanity goes down, and a tree is more than just branches. It's a lifestyle.\n\nIn this game, you’ll:\n🧱 Build the ultimate upgrade tree, and lactose tolerance\n⏫ Watch your stats skyrocket with absurdly broken mechanics\n💥 Reset, prestige, ascend, and question reality\n🐄 Possibly milk a cow. Spiritually.\n\nWhether you're into watching numbers rise, endlessly upgrading, or just really like incrementals, this game’s for you.\n\n🎉 Stop reading. Play it. Your unlimited empire awaits. 🎉\n\n🌟 Premium Perk: +20% Stats (yes, really)\n📢 v0.1.2 - Still early! Join our community to see what's next. (13+)\n\n⚠️ No exploits — we see all 🧀\n(Macros that repeat through that one sequence? Yeah, we cool with that.)","path":"/game/105344022671234-milky","slug":"105344022671234-milky","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/cbe951120e8c2d3a9b12e47aebb8fdb769dbc53abdc109435a2d4663f82db690.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5fe799b5c748ff08b6140238beb2b0a8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":3607032,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-10T13:41:30.800Z","creator":{"name":"Ultimate Engineers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":117782023218098,"name":"[🔥] Kick a Brainrot","desc":"🗣️ Welcome to Kick a Brainrot!\n\n👍 Like the game and join the group\n👀 Join